<article class="env-lemma" id="02TL">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/02TL">Lemma <span data-tag="02TL">115.23.2</span>.</a> Let $(S, \delta )$ be as in Chow Homology, Situation <a href="/tag/02QL" data-tag="02QL">42.7.1</a>. Let $X$ be locally of finite type over $S$. Let $X$ be integral and $n = \dim _\delta (X)$. Let $a \in \Gamma (X, \mathcal{O}_ X)$ be a nonzero function. Let $i : D = Z(a) \to X$ be the closed immersion of the zero scheme of $a$. Let $f \in R(X)^*$. In this case $i^*\text{div}_ X(f) = 0$ in $A_{n - 2}(D)$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Special case of Chow Homology, Lemma <a href="/tag/02TM" data-tag="02TM">42.30.1</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>